    @action leverage = clampStat(leverage + 2, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Run a covert interrogation ring through trusted serjeants, extract names fast, and strike the smuggling network off the books."
  __choice

