  @title "Sunspear Prison Confession with steel drawn"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "close"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/01-act1-kingsroad/frame-038.jpg"

  "In a rain-soaked gate camp, lantern light shakes over maps pinned with broken arrows and route markers. Yoren presses you to resolve a confession that could fracture your coalition in view of watching banners, while Jory Cassel tracks every pause for weakness that can be sold before dawn.

Roadside command has become coercive logistics: every lawful delay costs tempo, every hidden shortcut corrodes trust. If you move publicly, allies can verify terms but rivals gain time to obstruct. If you move covertly, you may keep convoys alive now and inherit a coalition that believes your oaths are instruments, not commitments.

No one asks whether someone will pay; they ask who pays first in coin, blood, reputation, or control. Your next order sets the pattern for every rider who leaves this road tonight."

  choice__
    @target "The Trident Salt Pact by the harbor chain"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action north_trust = clampStat(north_trust + 1, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Present a confession that could fracture your coalition before sworn witnesses, lock terms in written record, and accept immediate friction to preserve legitimacy."
